{"updated":"2026-11-13T11:19:23.666Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: US, Ukraine say Europe to join peace talks as Putin sticks to hardline stance. Elsewhere, fallout from Nvidia scandal spreads as Huang resigns. And peruvians flock to see Pope Leo XIV in city he served as bishop. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Ukraine, and Iran are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 2.8 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial up 0.9 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 6.9 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 30 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.8 near 148 km NW of Kavieng, Papua New Guinea. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.1,0.16,0.21,0.24,0.3,0.35,0.4,0.44,0.49,0.53,0.57,0.6,0.65,0.67,0.72,0.85,0.94,1.09,1.42,1.53,1.58,1.61,1.64,1.68,1.71,1.73,1.75,1.81,1.86,1.94,2,2.04,2.08,2.11,2.16,2.19,2.22,2.28,2.32,2.36,2.39,2.44,2.48,2.53,2.58,2.62,2.68,2.75,2.82,2.94,3.05,3.2,3.23,3.27,3.3,3.35,3.4,3.46,3.58,3.67,3.73,3.81,3.85,3.91,3.96,4,4.05,4.08,4.1,4.16,4.18,4.2,4.23,4.27,4.32,4.41,4.47,4.54,4.6,4.66,4.71,4.75,4.81,4.83,4.89,5,5.16,5.36,5.88,6.08,6.33,6.38,6.47,6.59,6.68,6.75,6.82,6.86,6.9,6.97,7.02,7.07,7.13,7.17,7.27,7.36,7.44,7.49,7.55,7.59,7.63,7.66,7.7,7.73,7.83,7.89,7.98,8.05,8.1,8.19,8.24,8.3,8.35,8.41,8.44,8.47,8.51,8.63,8.68,8.75,8.84,9.01,9.13,9.17,9.24,9.29,9.4,9.48,9.55,9.59,9.67,9.72,9.78,9.83,9.88,9.94,10,10.04,10.08,10.11,10.21,10.25,10.32,10.39,10.46,10.53,10.61,10.67,10.72,10.76,10.81,10.9,11.05,11.12,11.18,11.35,11.47,11.98,12.1,12.17,12.21,12.26,12.31,12.35,12.39,12.45,12.57,12.6,12.72,12.79,12.89,12.95,13.02,13.07,13.13,13.17,13.21,13.25,13.28,13.32,13.35,13.44,13.53,13.6,13.66,13.72,13.79,13.85,13.91,13.96,14.03,14.12,14.16,14.23,14.29,14.35,14.63,14.